  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added When/Unless conditions to the rule chain, opt-in indexed property names for collection failures, ValidationResult.ToDictionary(), and net10.0 plus XML docs/SourceLink packages. Fixed Should/ShouldAsync double-reporting and false-positive failures, IsUnique on value-typed collections, escaping exceptions from the int comparison overloads, null-collection/null-root handling, and WithMessage dropping AttemptedValue. Pinned System.Text.Encodings.Web to close a transitive Critical advisory.",
